  "changelog": "Initial release of geoskill-precipitation-nowcasting:\n\n- Implements optical flow (cross-correlation) based Lagrangian persistence nowcasting of precipitation, extrapolating fields 0\u20136 hours ahead.\n- Outputs forecast precipitation sequences in multi-band GeoTIFF and estimated displacement fields in JSON.\n- Supports input from local multi-band GeoTIFF or synthetic test data (Gaussian rain cells) for offline validation.\n- Runs fully offline with local computation; no network access or external data required.\n- Provides example usage for both synthetic and real radar/satellite data.\n- Licensed under MIT.",
